    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Exactly. So if it's just a tool for the powerful, then what's actually the point of these organizations? It feels like we're just pretending these institutions provide a moral check on power when, in reality, they just provide a veneer of legitimacy for whoever is running the show. Is there any actual, meaningful way for these institutions to be anything other than an instrument of hegemony?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
